
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#123b82">
  <title>LoanGrant | Simple Loan Applications</title>
  <meta name="description" content="LoanGrant - A simple and transparent loan application platform.">
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #17243b;
      background: #f5f8ff;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: white;
      padding: 17px 6%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px #0000000b;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #174a9c;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #27a6ed;
    }

    .nav-link {
      color: #174a9c;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 75px 7% 65px;
      background: linear-gradient(125deg, #123b82, #1769bd);
      color: white;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ffffff20;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff40;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(35px, 7vw, 54px);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #e4efff;
      max-width: 550px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .primary-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: white;
      color: #174a9c;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 55px 7%;
      max-width: 1050px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 29px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #173d79;
    }

    .section-intro {
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .feature {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid #e7edf7;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #173d790a;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .feature h3 {
      color: #174a9c;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .feature p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .application {
      background: white;
      padding: 35px 25px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #e5eaf3;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .application p {
      color: #64748b;
      margin: 12px 0 20px;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #fff2d8;
      color: #895b08;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .step {
      padding: 15px;
    }

    .step-number {
      background: #e5efff;
      color: #174a9c;
      display: inline-flex;
      width: 43px;
      height: 43px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #102c5d;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 15px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer p {
      color: #d0ddf1;
      margin-top: 7px;
    }

    @media(max-width: 500px) {
      .hero {
        padding: 55px 7%;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 42px 6%;
      }

      header {
        padding: 15px 5%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">Loan<span>Grant</span></div>
  <a class="nav-link" href="#about">About us</a>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <span class="tag">WELCOME TO LOANGRANT</span>
    <h1>Financial support starts with a simple application.</h1>
    <p>
      Explore our loan application service and find out how
      to submit a request for financial assistance.
    </p>
    <a href="#apply" class="primary-btn">Explore Loan Applications</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <h2 class="section-title">Why LoanGrant?</h2>
  <p class="section-intro">
    A straightforward approach to loan applications.
  </p>

  <div class="features">
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">📱</div>
      <h3>Easy Registration</h3>
      <p>Designed for convenient registration using your mobile phone.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">🔐</div>
      <h3>Phone Verification</h3>
      <p>Phone ownership verification will help protect customer accounts.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">📋</div>
      <h3>Loan Applications</h3>
      <p>Submit loan requests and follow their review status.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="section-title">How It Works</h2>
  <p class="section-intro">Our planned application process.</p>

  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">1</div>
      <h3>Register</h3>
      <p>Create your customer account.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">2</div>
      <h3>Verify</h3>
      <p>Confirm ownership of your phone number.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">3</div>
      <h3>Apply</h3>
      <p>Submit your loan application.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">4</div>
      <h3>Review</h3>
      <p>Receive an update after application review.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="apply">
  <div class="application">
    <span class="status">APPLICATION PORTAL IN DEVELOPMENT</span>
    <h2 style="margin-top:18px;color:#173d79">
      Loan applications coming soon
    </h2>
    <p>
      We are preparing our secure customer registration,
      phone verification and loan application system.
      Applications are not yet being accepted.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <h2>LoanGrant</h2>
  <p>Simple. Secure. Transparent.</p>
  <p>© 2026 LoanGrant. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
